		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=12027#p12027"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>c&#039;est la version postgres 8.1</p><p>j&#039;ai le répertoire main avec ceci</p><p>base&#160; <br />global&#160; pg_clog&#160; <br />pg_multixact&#160; <br />pg_subtrans&#160; <br />pg_tblspc&#160; <br />pg_twophase&#160; <br />PG_VERSION&#160; <br />pg_xlog&#160; <br />postmaster.opts&#160; <br />root.crt&#160; <br />server.crt&#160; <br />server.key</p>]]></content>
